{"id":"79a758be0d442e63","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-gap-problem.md","title":"Gap Promise Problem","display":"df-gap-problem — Gap Promise Problem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-gap-problem","aliases":["28-df-gap-problem","Gap Promise Problem"],"display":"df-gap-problem — Gap Promise Problem","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 11.13; local general promise-problem interface","source_printed_pages":"245","source_pdf_pages":"271","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-gap-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-gap-problem</span><span>Gap Promise Problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gap-problem — Gap Promise Problem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 11.13; local general promise-problem interface"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"245"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"271"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y},\\Pi_{\\mathsf N})\">\\(\\Pi=(\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y},\\Pi_{\\mathsf N})\\)</span>，两分量均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 的子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(M:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Promise}(\\Pi)\\leftrightarrow\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y}\\cap\\Pi_{\\mathsf N}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Promise}(\\Pi)\\leftrightarrow\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y}\\cap\\Pi_{\\mathsf N}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Solves}(M,\\Pi)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Promise}(\\Pi)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y}\\ M(x)=1)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf N}\\ M(x)=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Solves}(M,\\Pi)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Promise}(\\Pi)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y}\\ M(x)=1)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf N}\\ M(x)=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\Pi\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Promise}(\\Pi)\\land\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ [(\\forall x\\in L\\ f(x)\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y})\\land(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ f(x)\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf N})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\Pi\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Promise}(\\Pi)\\land\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ [(\\forall x\\in L\\ f(x)\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y})\\land(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ f(x)\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf N})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>归约必须把每个输入送进承诺内的正确一侧；承诺外不规定求解器行为。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.13，印刷页 245；PDF 页 271。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R7复核：实际核对 Definition 11.13（PDF271）：源文针对val=1与val&lt;ρ的Gap-qCSP；本节点抽出一般不交YES/NO集合及保承诺归约，是可复用的本地一般化接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$f\\in\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Pi=(\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y},\\Pi_{\\mathsf N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"M:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Promise}(\\Pi)\\leftrightarrow\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y}\\cap\\Pi_{\\mathsf N}=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Solves}(M,\\Pi)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Promise}(\\Pi)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y}\\ M(x)=1)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf N}\\ M(x)=0).","display":true},{"tex":"L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\Pi\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Promise}(\\Pi)\\land\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ [(\\forall x\\in L\\ f(x)\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf Y})\\land(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ f(x)\\in\\Pi_{\\mathsf N})].","display":true}],"bytes":1754,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"PCP：[[28-df-pcp]]、[[28-thm-pcp]]、[[28-df-gap-problem]]、[[28-df-max-3sat]]、[[28-thm-pcp-gap-hardness]]。"},{"id":"a6ab1076181efd97","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_3$、$\\operatorname{enc}_3$、$\\operatorname{val}$ 见 [[28-df-max-3sat]]；语言到承诺问题的归约见 [[28-df-gap-problem]]。"}],"outgoing":["adb92775ec020a0b"]}